      "comment": "The saved rationales for a_007 and a_014 explicitly state the arrival date (2 June 1871), naturalization date (13 August 1875), the interval (approximately four years and two months), and the five-year legal requirement. The shortfall is clearly acknowledged, and both links are capped at probable or below. The required information is present, so I consider the identity decisions and links correct."
