      "comment": "The confidence levels are appropriately calibrated. The Great Register assertions are linked at probable, while the passenger-index assertions are linked at speculative because of the very low match score of 0.006. The naturalization shortfall is explicitly acknowledged and does not cause an unjustified speculative downgrade. The confidence decisions follow the stated rules."
