      "comment": "I checked the saved person_evidence entries and their rationales. I agree that the confidence levels are too high. The links for a_008 and a_009 are supported by the name, age, birthplace, and existing 1860 census link, but pe_004 comes from the same census record and is not independent corroboration. The 1850 census could provide additional support, but it is not discussed in the rationales. For a_010, the relationship is inferred from household position rather than explicitly stated. I would rate these links as probable rather than confident."
